Predicting Member Retention in Recreational Sports Programs
Author: Gerardo
Course: Graduate Data Science Final Project
Date: October 2026

Overview
This project builds a predictive framework for member retention using data from a recreational sports club. The dataset includes ~5000 members with demographic and membership‑status information. The goal is to identify retention patterns and build prototype models that classify retention risk.

Files Included
data/members_all.csv — full dataset

data/cleaned_memberships/*.csv — separated membership files

src/load_data.py — data loading

src/feature_engineering.py — feature creation

src/modeling.py — logistic regression, decision tree, clustering

src/visualization.py — charts

main.py — pipeline runner

notebooks/final_project.ipynb — full notebook version
